Subject: [PATCH 21/49] m3: draw opaque batches first, then blended by priority

Opaque batches (blend mode 0) in file order, then blended batches by material priority ascending, stable, after WhiteoutFlakes TransparentOrder. Replaces the commented-out sort. M3Batch.fileOrder keeps the file position; M3ModelInstance.drawnOrder records what the last renderOpaque drew.
